        "created_at": "2017-12-05T23:12:02.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If, on a single board, all Explores are cancled by Wilds tokens, does the Escalation effect still happen on that board?</p><p>Escalation: After Exploring, on each board, pick a land of the shown terrain. If it has a building, add one blight. Otherwise, add one town.</p><p>In the game we assumed yes, becasue it doesn't specify \"After succesfully Exploring[...]\", but I wasn't sure.</p>",
