        "raw": "<p>If, on a single board, all Explores are cancled by Wilds tokens, does the Escalation effect still happen on that board?</p><p>Escalation: After Exploring, on each board, pick a land of the shown terrain. If it has a building, add one blight. Otherwise, add one town.</p><p>In the game we assumed yes, becasue it doesn&#39;t specify &quot;After succesfully Exploring[...]&quot;, but I wasn&#39;t sure.</p>",
